// --- beur-hagra (21) ---
patchFile('siman_033/beur-hagra/part-001.txt', 'beur-hagra', {
  '1#_': `And it can, etc. As in mishnah chapter 3 "this is the rule, all," etc.; and some books have this statement in gemara (54b):`,
  '2#_': `According to Rambam, etc. As above "this is the rule"; no animal like this lives; mishnah does not differ in something impossible in its day like heart removed, etc.; proof it was not counted among kosher signs like lower cheek:`,
  '3#א': `Into cavity. Tosafot 42a s.v. punctured, etc.:`,
  '3#ב': `Neveilah. As there 32b, 32a:`,
  '4#א': `And they were punctured, etc. Ritva; as written possible, etc.; and it is gemara there:`,
  '4#ב': `And all this not, etc. Tosafot there 28 s.v. came; forced to say, etc.; for us who rule like Rashi — must be so; and so Rosh chapter 3 seif 4:`,
  '5#א': `And likewise, etc. Yes — if one reversed even one of them. (Likut) And likewise if, etc. But Hagahot permits; and Hagahot there; and so Teshuvot HaRishonim from Rashi except Tosafot uncertain — stringent; Hagahot permits; language "reversed" like lung siman 37a and Berakhot 61b old person, etc.; there seems one of them; nevertheless tanna interpreted, etc.; also Rosh: puncture to removal entirely — none; lung permitted even entire removal; flaw not from removal — through flaw friend also flawed; even in puncture; Rashi's view impossible; if flaw here in animal weakness see quality — hot caused even white membrane red — how red become white; two opposites on one subject; how flaw ruled white membrane and red become white; impossible; Rashi therefore requires flaw in both else friend protects; how reversal to reversal; Rashi truth: outer white inner red — only white reddened from weakness, inner reddened not from weakness but derusah; clear. (Likut) For halachah first explanation main — both reversed; so Rashi; Teshuvot HaRishonim wrote practically; Shmuel; Rosh distinction partial to entire — none; lung peeled, etc.; should distinguish flaw to puncture even slightly; language reversed like all exchanges; lung exchange three flaws kosher — main — end:`,
  '5#ב': `And all the more if, etc. As written there 58b:`,
  '6#_': `What should one do, etc. There 28b. (Likut) And if animal, etc. Not like Rashi 43b s.v. that one, etc.; another view in Teshuvot HaRishonim, Tur, Beit Yosef; some distinguish, etc.; in short Rashi's system: even for puncture no examination outside; derusah examination after slaughter; remedy even animal; Tur in name Ba'al HaTerumah; Ran in name Rabeinu Ephraim; Teshuvot HaRishonim in name R' Yitzchak; but some say animal no examination at all — main; Tosafot puncture has examination even outside; Teshuvot HaRishonim and Shulchan Aruch agree Rashi; another view puncture known place has examination; unknown cannot examine — end:`,
  '7#_': `Regarding puncture, etc. Rashi there 28a but not his words that derusah has examination for animal too — see 43b. (Likut) And regarding, etc. As written 28 Teshuvot HaRishonim that goose, etc.; and Rashi s.v. drips, etc.; s.v. no, etc.; there 43b s.v. what, etc.; not like Rivba in Tosafot 28 s.v. came; and that he adjoined doubt of derusah incidentally teaches concerned for doubt derusah — Teshuvot HaRishonim; therefore also adjoined derusah not practical difference for derusah — end. (Likut) Seif 6-7 regarding puncture; seif 8 but, etc. Rivba in Tosafot: where we rely on signs — no examination, not concerned for puncture; wrote puncture discernible outside; that goose chapter 2 derusah — see — end:`,
  '8#א': `Bird, etc. Not concerned. 53b:`,
  '8#ב': `To examine, etc. Tosafot 25a s.v. came; can say gemara, etc.:`,
  '9#א': `If no drop, etc. See below:`,
  '9#ב': `But if stuck, etc. We rule like Shmuel in derusah:`,
  '9#ג': `(Likut) Perhaps, etc. healed. Rashi two interpretations on healed; depends on dispute above seif 6 whether examination outside for puncture — if not, concerned healed; thereby hidden proof Ra'avan Rosh hagahah we rule like Ula beit ha-kosot puncture seen outside unlike here; Shulchan Aruch words require study; Shach forced — his words not seen; see Tur — end:`,
  '9#ד': `And some permit, etc. Like Ula; unlike doubt derusah — there basis; gemara did not elaborate here; see 53 all doubt on, etc.:`,
  '9#ה': `If no, etc. Tosafot there s.v. sat; as beit ha-kosot; therefore also here if no, etc.; as there one-sided puncture R' Shimon case:`,
  '10#_': `(Likut) Separated, etc. Tosafot 42b s.v. signs; Rashi and as written possible; gemara there; if separated dangling — from jaw; therefore asks Shmuel; answers that which says crop area, etc. — folded from jaw; Tosafot 44a s.v. and there; Rif wrote both folded and dangled — treifah; explains also questioner holds separated means separated; asks like dangling treifah majority; answers crop area folded from jaw; Rambam explains Rif first answer folded, etc.; Rosh omitted; tanna tanna until Metzaref; even mishnah, etc. until difficult; need not delete even Rif and Rif — end:`,
  '11#א': `Crop removed, etc. There question in gemara whether ruled like Rabbi or not:`,
  '11#ב': `Even, etc. Otherwise treifah per s.v. can live, etc.; and as above seif 6:`,
  '11#ג': `Punctured, etc. Included in children of intestines — Rashi 58b s.v. opposite them:`,
});

