  '5#ב': `Two tracheae — connected beginning and end also connected — Rama in Krakow forbade Maharatz in slaughterings; Pri Chadash permits; Peleti forbids; male goose trachea changed — almost two tracheae majority — not literally two — permitted:`,
  '5#ג': `Treifah neveilah as if removed; above siman 41 dispute poskim and Ramban:`,
  '6#_': `If bird, etc. — though l'chatchila two signs, here only one sign b'dieved:`,
  '8#א': `And neck — from life; dirt on neck after shechitah — unnecessary:`,
