  '8#ג': `We not expert — wonder: nevertheless concern healed as below; see Peleti extended:`,
  '9#א': `Or width — many stringent even width — perhaps was stuck; Peleti no need stringent; caterpillar in esophagus eating half inner skin — Pri Chadash permits — main; see there:`,
  '9#ב': `If no drop — but with drop forbidden; Shach specifically when stuck; Pri Chadash disputes; Peleti strengthened Shach view:`,
