patchFile('siman_033/pitchei-teshuva/part-001.txt', 'pitchei-teshuva', {
  '1#_': `Esophagus, etc. See Shach s.k. 4 what wondered on Rambam and Mechaber; see Nofet Tzufim parashat Bamidbar what answered; see Pnei Aryeh siman 26; responsum Beit Shmuel aharon Yoreh Deah siman 25:`,
  '2#_': `Punctured. See responsum Noda Biyehudah Yoreh Deah siman 9: even if punctured near head where attached to flesh flesh does not seal — treifah; see responsum Teshuvah Me'ahavah chelek 1 siman 86; explains Tur words therefore wherever punctured treifah — see there:`,
  '3#_': `(But if there is concern, etc.) Taz below siman 49 s.k. 3 challenged what written there Shulchan Aruch seif 4 regarding gizzard puncture rely on doubt to lenient — therefore raised there to stringent; see responsum Chavot Yair siman 25 wrote accustomed answer doubt punctured esophagus is doubt neveilah — doubt in slaughter — stringent in doubt more than other treifos slaughtered permitted; in this reasoning innovated in several laws; found now so in Peleti siman 33 s.k. 4; also in his Beit HaSafek; after examination returned clarified not so — doubt in slaughter to stringent is doubt in act of slaughter or paused or derusah or windpipe dangling; not dependent on slaughter act; animal presumption majority esophagi not punctured; though presumption not slaughtered until clarified proper slaughter; whatever done properly doubt punctured esophagus rely majority like all treifos; many proofs — see there siman 17, 24, 46 brought partly below siman 41 s.k. 4; Taz difficulty main as Kenesset HaGedolah there esophagus different all animals baraita eat thorns therefore more stringent rely common — see there:`,
  '4#_': `Treifah. Bayit HaTov wrote Darkei Moshe name Darkei Moshe actual exchange even slightly treifah; so Tevu'ot Shor; agreed responsum Noda Biyehudah taniyna Yoreh Deah siman 15; wrote there if redness passed through narrowing in saliva can permit — hang redness on slaughter heat; wrote further no need check after redness inner skin for white outer since Hagahot Derishah Rashi Maharshal Taz hold white outside no flaw — entirely kosher — stringent if sees white but not search; appears if two winds impossible align — all kosher as above seif 4 puncture; simple; know Bayit HaTov Mahari"t words strange cited Darkei Moshe after wrote stam Maharshal both white kosher (Bayit HaTov also cited end in name Taz); not as responsum Noda Biyehudah Tevu'ot Shor — therefore even actual exchange kosher any amount; only for us who rule forbid both white any amount treifah — see there:`,
  '5#_': `(And if animal.) See responsum Chavot Yair siman 27 explaining Tur words:`,
  '6#_': `Dirty with blood. Bayit HaTov in name Taz; see responsum Me'il Tzedakah siman 38 wrote not to stringent — correct to rule so — see there:`,
  '7#_': `For doubt of puncture. See responsum Noda Biyehudah taniyna Yoreh Deah siman 23: bird head skin pierced opposite nape — permit — who returned signs behind nape — concern esophagus puncture; must examine piercing if not deep from sides; if no flaw in fat meat deep sides — permit — see there:`,
  '8#_': `And some permit. See Shach s.k. 21; see responsum Noda Biyehudah Yoreh Deah siman 8:`,
  '9#_': `We do not concern perhaps healed. Shach s.k. 21 what wrote to reconcile not difficult from above end seif 4 hagahah; see responsum Emunat Shmuel siman 34 answered another way:`,
  '10#_': `Where there is flaw. Bayit HaTov. Taz explained even if fattening blow ruled part outer membrane — no prohibition; even majority ruled not as entirety; permit if minority remains disease did not rule at all — see there; see responsum Emunat Shmuel siman 33 wise man questioned Taz words; also Gaon Maharash of Prague very stringent; he answered if separating skins no outer flaw — not stringent; all decisors his city practiced; if flaw ruled part outer — one whose heart not stinging rely b'dieved on Taz words — permission in his hand we cannot protest; see responsum Or Zarua Panim Me'rot chelek 2 siman 13 wrote per Taz lenient even if blow ruled outer skin — same if drop blood between two esophagus membranes kosher — certainly not less than if blow ruled outer; where ruled — ruled; where not ruled — no presumption flaw; therefore practice separate skins certainly per geonim I saw responsum second thread very stringent agreed permit where one skin punctured disease did not rule second at all; if ruled outer skin — treifah therefore peeled; but practice all our lands per Taz — why peel since see outer intact no drop outside suffices; these matters said end siman 103 — see there; see Petach HaBayit from Maharar Avraham Tikotin siman 11 s.v. further saw wrote doubt fattened geese flaw outer esophagus from woman grasps neck at fattening — say also like disease — if say worse outside — requires study — end; see also responsum Or Zarua Panim Me'rot chelek 1 siman 1 lengthy many refinements esophagus laws; see responsum Shvut Yaakov chelek 2 siman 56 wrote even responsum Panim Me'rot chelek 1 siman 1 rejects Taz two hands (now Panim Me'rot chelek 1 not before us — examine; in Panim Me'rot chelek 2 above clear contrary Taz view) his words not compelled; rely b'dieved on Taz ruled we have no treifah unless flaw ruled entire outer or majority (seems wonder Taz wrote explicitly majority not as entirety) basis to praise lenient not concern outer punctured healed like sat thorn esophagus because there thorn stuck with force concern punctured through-and-through then healed over days; unlike here fattening force if punctured through-and-through would not heal since fatten daily hole widen not heal raise membrane — see there; see responsum Chavot Yair siman 25 wrote main like Taz fattening flaw like disease though Kenesset HaGedolah disputes; in general reasoning disputes; main Taz; so Peleti ruled; accustomed warn fatteners on Turkish wheat called chitti hatogerma cook first soften thorn in root; fatten at night in balls warn sift bran remove chaff stick esophagus then rely Taz; nevertheless b'dieved if not done — permit fattened geese found puncture (not ruled outside) not clear thorn or disease; see there also question hairs stuck esophagus; wrote regarding actual thorn stuck esophagus every decisor careful spirit not permit Chullin even peeled separated outer not ruled inner — heaven forbid permit against majority poskim and all acharonim (see Sefer Tiferet Moshe wrote explicitly permit; saw decisors practice separate if inner not through-and-through permit if inner through-and-through forbid — see Bayit Yehudah); nevertheless case hairs stuck in puncture questioner found many times very hard remove hair from puncture — appears not from outside; no puncture at all perhaps esophagus growth doctor testimony Rambam end chapter HaMa'lad — not rely permit plainly without examination; examination outer side inner skin even actual thorn Ramban Rosh permit; even for us forbid; hairs not thorns puncturing — adhered puncture doubt disease thorn rely Taz fattened geese since not ruled outside kosher (slight study could permit even inner through-and-through per Taz earlier); only Kenesset HaGedolah stringent fattening flaw — add perhaps no puncture at all growth esophagus; combining all I agree permit after examination not without; hair only; actual thorn etc. heaven forbid even with examination — see there; see responsum Maharam Ziskind siman 4 and 5; Bayit HaTov s.k. before in name Chokhmat Binyamin feathers found — see Emunat Shmuel siman 13; see what wrote below siman 51 s.k. 7; also responsum Maharam Lublin community enacted examine esophagi then threw heads without examine — kosher b'dieved see there lengthy; see Beit Efrayim Yoreh Deah siman 6 brought briefly above siman 31 explained permit like Maharam Lublin unlike lung adhesion minority frequent definite treifah not here though common flaw esophagus not frequent definite treifah only sometimes puncture or flaw only inner outer intact — see there at length; greater responsum Or Zarua Panim Me'rot chelek 1 siman 1 and chelek 2 siman 103 even if initially flaw inner clearly no complete opening did not check drop lost esophagus — permit — see there; responsum Chavot Yair siman 24 main like Maharam Lublin do not budge; Maharam Lublin only lost without examination; when flaw then lost without examination forbid — Shach siman 41 s.k. 23 — end; see responsum Pri Tevu'ah siman 15 community fence not fatten geese with consent community av beit din proclaimed in enactment; one violated and fattened — forbid him and household; others permitted — he homeowner not accustomed trouble fatten to sell others enough we penalized he and household not eat; if such come to seller for others — others law like cooked for them — see there:`,
  '11#_': `Intestine punctured. Bayit HaTov in name Beit Yehudah Pri Chadash; see Petach HaBayit siman 12 wrote bird without crop like goose bar goose — needle stuck flesh near gizzard toward esophagus not outside kosher — all the more permit several times in bar geese flesh like blisters cutting worms many inside not punctured outside — further leniency perhaps disease from rot; reason can lenient also bird with crop; see Peri Megadim Mishbetzot s.k. 21; see responsum Chavot Yair siman 28 also asked on blisters bar geese end esophagus near gizzard like buttons or bubbles opening worms live; sometimes punctures in bubbles inside esophagus — what law; answered all from those bar geese sense testifies worms their species multiplied not from outside; opening buttons hundreds fine hairs wound circle remove separate; many such buttons each mostly upper bubble flesh doctor scraped; therefore decisor must turn bubble examine if blow did not rule outer bubble flesh doctor scraped — like punctured both sides treifah; if flesh beyond second side intact beautiful no concern only worms — certainly if no punctures both sides by worms forbid per Derishah like Shach siman 31 s.k. 7 only gizzard lenient thick skin; other organ no outer flaw no presumption flaw; esophagus no examination outside for this since anyway doubt live separated after death or not; most buttons from gizzard section not esophagus section; also not concerned healed — worm puncturing does not allow healing; better than stuck thorn; all per clear worms born birds themselves; if concern came from outside as questioner thought — depend dispute Shach siman 36 s.k. 15 — end see there:`,
});

