patchFile('siman_033/rabbi-akiva-eiger-yd/part-001.txt', 'rabbi-akiva-eiger-yd', {
  '1#_': `(Siman 33 s.k. 3) In any amount neveilah. Difficult Tosafot chapter 2 Chullin slaughtered minority esophagus and waited shechitah time and completed slaughter — or punctured esophagus then slaughtered both — treifah and its slaughter purifies; explicitly punctured esophagus not neveilah; from sugya inverse not found — only stopped animal life from sign — requires study:`,
  '2#_': `(There s.k. 5) One does not give sages' words measures. If while outer still somewhat white above and inner punctured far below — in situation appearing impossible align — can discuss lenient since even both punctured such forbidden only because not divided — rabbinic; rely on poskim both white kosher — white not called flaw; even if puncture situation possibly align with white place — say perhaps alignment doubt perhaps aligned; if so double doubt not aligned and doubt poskim white not flaw; at least far situation impossible align — discuss lenient; requires study for law:`,
  '3#_': `(Seif 6) Then turn esophagus and examine inside. Tur language. Implies inside examination alone helps; Tur holds main first answer Rosh: because lenient in doubt derusah since impossible otherwise; but second answer Rosh: only if venom permeated inside and nothing remained outside only mark outside — not discernible outside; while not permeated venom discernible outside; requires inside and outside examination — see there; Tur ruled first answer — see Bach; I did not merit understand Rosh why lenient impossible otherwise — animal no remedy examining inside — perhaps slaughter at venom place permitted from doubt derusah since impossible examination; what difference concern venom ruled inner or only outer will permeate; forced say this language venom ruled outer no mark inner; Rosh language does not imply; from necessity difficulty appears say if venom only outer — though treifah from end — not invalidated by slaughter since sign not corrupted only treifah from end will not live; not neveilah; if doubt perhaps ruled inner — doubt in slaughter; bird inside examination — no neveilah no doubt slaughter — lenient from doubt; still requires study; also why first answer not require examine outside too — fixed matter certainly venom not seen outside — not rely outside examination perhaps trickery sign not discernible venom; why lenient entirely from doubt not require even outside examination; what possible clarify perhaps mark venom and if not seen lighten from doubt; from Rosh words appears first lenient doubt derusah automatically stringency definite derusah does not help inside examination — perhaps outer venom; wonder Tur siman 57 animal derusah no remedy — know derusah also bird no remedy per force Tur here main first answer Rosh; truly question on Rosh above case dripping blood definite derusah why concludes puncture has examination outside — that goose deals derusah saw cat chased as Rosh wrote; since saw cat chased and goose before us dripping blood as saw derusah — what need remedy inside examination; say nevertheless doubt derusah — perhaps cat tore neck teeth or legs; Tur animal derusah [also bird no remedy] requires study; from Rosh words difficult Rashi if puncture no examination outside why practical difference derusah not puncture — Rashi implies "only from inside" also novelty puncture obvious inside examination; therefore say doubt derusah novelty inside examination helps not concern venom outside like Rosh difficulty; examine; found so Kenesset HaPesachim; see Pri Chadash wrote main Ran's answer even if ruled outer nevertheless not rule inner — signs hard at derusah not skin to skin; Ran only his view ruled both red or white kosher friend protects — if not rule inner kosher; Pri Chadash ruled Rosh both red treifah entirely flawed friend does not protect; what difference not rule inner — nevertheless permeates outer skin itself like gizzard we say discoloration lightly entirely flawed not sustained inner alone; Rosh contradicts Ran — forced say until signs themselves redden from inside; not hidden short all outer will be flawed; wanted include difficulty even Ittur brought Rosh earlier both red kosher; law if ruled both red treifah; Ran view void; Pri Chadash erred here:`,
  '4#_': `(Seif 8) Bird before us neck dirty examine dirty place. Clearly need examine only dirty place; Shach (ot 15) explanation from inside opposite dirty; therefore if not dirty only part neck even animal has remedy per Mechaber slaughter above dirty examine inside dirty; so explicitly Kenesset HaPesachim; wonder Mechaber contradicts — above siman 23 seif 6 slaughtered bird waited if punctured esophagus return slaughter only trachea elsewhere — clearly animal no remedy; why can slaughter above below and examine; must say nevertheless concern perhaps slaughtered at puncture place since compressed perhaps bottom esophagus above when waited; same dirty neck — requires study:`,
  '5#_': `(Seif 8 hagahah) Or animal. Difficult — even per Mechaber forbidden — no remedy examine inside — perhaps slaughtered at puncture — requires study:`,
  '6#_': `(Taz s.k. 16) Ba'al Sefer HaTerumah permits even, etc. My view not necessary — say stuck kosher — if punctured outside who required him; as Rosh even Ula inner alone without stuck treifah; say same found with drop inside worse — drop proves at least stuck inside turned back — superior doubt perhaps also outer punctured; examine:`,
  '7#_': `(There seif 9) Concern perhaps punctured and healed. Tevu'ot Shor forced Rashi healed means healed; nevertheless all concern puncture — Rashi esophagus no examination outside; if truly not concern puncture — no concern healed — Ula should say not concerned perhaps punctured; say why Rashi exchange treifah both removed from proper place — not appearance flaw like lung; reason reversed outer should be inside inner outside each removed from place; both red or white kosher as Teshuvot HaRishonim; from language exchange implies literally reversed; Ran Rashi both red treifah derusah; both white kosher; say Ula not concerned healed means concerned punctured; where know not punctured such both white — remedy examine outer not punctured here not concerned healed; clear; Tosafot Rosh contradict Rashi if puncture no outside — punctured one without other kosher how find — Rava two membranes outer red inner white punctured one without other kosher — clearly even red esophagus punctured one without other kosher; Tevu'ot Shor difficulty Tosafot contradict Rashi puncture no outside from punctured one without other kosher; also difficulty them why kosher — concern healed; my view Tosafot never concern healed — healed means punctured; proved puncture has outside examination; that "healed" means no examination needed — no concern perhaps punctured — simple; seemingly Tosafot view gemara for us doubt derusah and healed — say slaughtered permitted; answered derusah common; therefore concern healed thorn puncture common; Tosafot explicitly Yevamot; if explain healed healed — for us concern healed — how say thorn puncture common; end we see thorn not punctured outside now before hour two — concern day or two punctured outside healed; doubt thorn came there only nearby; common swallowed thorn long ago; therefore certainly not say since thorns commonly puncture outside certainly this thorn punctured outside — proven thorn sat time healed therefore outer not punctured now — since once punctured does not puncture again finally why not puncture outside again — nature not puncture outside again; clear Tosafot do not explain healed healed; examine; nevertheless Tosafot Chullin 50 and Shabbat end imply R' Yehudah healed means healed — requires study; seemingly therefore gemara outer red — if exchange treifah whence this case — perhaps kosher exchange; Rava outer red — if wrote stam punctured one without other kosher would think certainly know both not punctured such both white — inner punctured has remedy examining outer; red outer — concern outer punctured not discernible — Rava teaches even red esophagus punctured one without other kosher; teaches puncture has outside examination; nevertheless not so difficult — say gemara novelty puncture has outside examination:`,
  '8#_': `(Shach s.k. 21) Further resolve first difficulty. So explicitly Rosh — Ula permits only such; without thorn before us forbidden even Ula:`,
  '9#_': `(Nekudat HaKesef s.k. 18) Difficult words, etc. When puncture in inner; if only flaw blisters no outer flaw — kosher as Taz; agreed Tevu'ot Shor:`,
  '10#_': `(Taz s.k. 18) On inner skin from disease. Torat Chaim wrote if no puncture only inner flawed blisters — kosher no outer flaw; if inside at flaw place puncture — forbidden; agreed Tevu'ot Shor:`,
  '11#_': `(Seif 11 hagahah) Intestine punctured between crop. See Sefer HaYashar to Rabbenu Tam siman 108 wrote only thick flesh on gizzard like walnut doubt belongs gizzard; what between crop and that flesh — simple law like crop — see there:`,
});

