patchFile('siman_033/nekudot-hakesef/part-001.txt', 'nekudot-hakesef', {
  '1#_': `(Siman 33 Shach s.k. 4) I proved punctured esophagus and majority windpipe severed not neveilah while alive; challenged Rambam; appears Rambam also so as Bach his view; brought Siftei Kohen siman 34 seif 3 small; Rambam does not say "behold neveilah while alive" but write afterward slaughter does not help — means even after slaughter neveilah not impart tumah while alive; so Derishah this siman seif 4 per Rambam; found proof Rambam chapter 2 Laws Fathers Impurity and pure invalidated by slaughter still twitching or slaughtered one or majority one — no tumah at all until dies; part animal two years; thigh removed and voided — neveilah imparts carrying and contact though still alive — end; one or majority slaughtered not neveilah while alive until dies — gemara chapter HaOr VeHaRotav Chullin 121b:`,
  '2#_': `(Taz s.k. 16) Brings Hagahot Maimoniyot forbid found thorn with drop even inside; wrote Siftei Kohen s.k. 17 Hagahot Maimoniyot does not decide — deals sat thorn not found; what wants prove from gemara even drop inside treifah from "but found not needed Ula" all animals baraita eat thorns — nothing; obvious when drop and no thorn — no prohibition as stated; if so means where you thought say because found — found nothing since all animals baraita eat thorns — like drop without any found — obvious drop does not raise lower; Orach Chaim brought nothing — discernible inner flaw means stuck inside inside — so explicitly there — see there:`,
  '3#_': `(There s.k. 18 Taz) Wants learn permission for fattening from Tosafot Rosh — no proof here — they deal disease by itself; here from hard things fattening — as constantly punctured thorn needle — what difference punctured once or gradually:`,
  '4#_': `(Hagahah Shach s.k. 21) And say there wrote per Mechaber, etc. Requires study — not seif 4 view Rosh; here also Rosh view; difficult contradictions; also what wrote "can say Shach holds" etc. implies if outer punctured not concern inner perhaps healed — has examination inside; why siman 48 mass not help inside — reason healed specifically esophagus outer red unlike inner white; same mass; what difference; seems resolve Hagahot Maimoniyot z"l — no difficulty per what wrote s.k. 20 deals inner skin not punctured through-and-through — "some permit" applies; seif 4 deals inner through-and-through; resolves second difficulty Shach why gave reason perhaps healed since inner healed say outer also healed — therefore need reason no examination; hagahah practiced if not punctured both sides — both sides of inner; view also Taz seif 18 small; (Rosh himself wrote distinction stuck versus found puncture as Hagahot Maimoniyot z"l) — examine:`,
});

// --- kaf-hachayim (11) ---
patchFile('siman_033/kaf-hachayim/part-001.txt', 'kaf-hachayim', {
  '1#_': `(Seif 1) Lower cheek removed kosher — case no removal of signs as above siman 24 seif 15 and Taz; Shach s.k. 1; Pri Chadash ot 1 Lechem Panim ot 1 Levush ot 1 Kereti ot 1 Zivchei Todah ot 1:`,
  '2#_': `There. And can live through hamara and haleta — insert into swallowing chamber until cannot return — hamara; where can return — haleta; Shabbat 135b; Taz s.k. 2; and so acharonim:`,
  '3#_': `And likewise can give it drink — otherwise cannot live; Bach; Kenesset HaGedolah Hagahot Beit Yosef ot 6 Shulchan Gavoah ot 2 Bayit Tzvi ot 2 Mekor Chaim ot 1 Ein Mishpat siman 5 ot 1 Zivchei Tzedek ot 2:`,
  '4#_': `And you will ask: whence know estimate cannot live through hamara and haleta — if we saw it walks and diminishes and when feeding refuses and not desirous — this indicates cannot live through hamara and haleta; Perishah ot 1 Ein Mishpat there; Zivchei Tzedek ot 3:`,
  '5#_': `And not specifically removed — even created lacking lower cheek or lacking upper cheek — law like removed; Ein Mishpat there; Zivchei Tzedek ot 4 and ot 7:`,
  '6#_': `There hagahah. And bird beak removed and can live, etc. — specifically lower beak; upper beak even if can live through hamara and haleta — treifah; Darkei Moshe; Kenesset HaGedolah Hagahot Beit Yosef ot 7 Tevu'ot Shor ot 2 Mishnat Zekeinim ot 1 Zera Avraham ch. 3 summary five treifos ot 10; Zivchei Todah ot 3; Chokhmat Adam kelal 16 ot 1; Bayit Tzvi ot 1 Mekor Chaim ot 1 Ein Mishpat there ayin 2 Zivchei Tzedek ot 5:`,
  '7#_': `There hagahah. And can live, etc. — and can give drink too; Bach; Mekor Chaim there; see above ot 3:`,
  '8#_': `Incident — rooster lower cheek punctured until tongue exited through puncture — permitted because lower cheek removed kosher; Be'er Mayim Chayim ot 1 from Maharar Shaul av beit din Krakow; Zivchei Tzedek ot 6; and can live through hamara and haleta as stated:`,
  '9#_': `(Seif 2) Upper cheek removed — treifah; and likewise created lacking upper cheek treifah as above ot 5:`,
  '10#_': `There. To Rambam treifah, etc. — and Pri Chadash ot 3 in name several rishonim like Rambam treifah; wrote and so main; Tevu'ot Shor ot 3 Shulchan Gavoah ot 4 Zera Avraham there; Biur HaGra ot 2 Chokhmat Adam there; Bayit Tzvi there; Ein Mishpat ot 1 Zivchei Tzedek ot 7:`,
  '11#_': `Reason for language until tonsil — tonsil throat kosher; with tonsil treifah; Rokeach siman 298; Tevu'ot Shor ot 1 Shulchan Gavoah machon ot 3 Mishnat Zekeinim ot 2 Machatzit HaShekel ot 2 Bayit Tzvi ot 2 Ein Mishpat there ot 3 Taz siman 67 ot 4 and ot 5 Zivchei Tzedek ot 8:`,
});

// --- mateh-yehonatan (7) ---
patchFile('siman_033/mateh-yehonatan/part-001.txt', 'mateh-yehonatan', {
  '1#_': `(Siman 33 seif 2) Upper cheek removed treifah, etc. — commentators hold Rambam comes under "this is the rule all unlike it lives"; if so why teach eighteen treifos told Moshe at Sinai — should say all unlike it lives; not explain like head removed made gistera; lower cheek removed like head removed; same all treifos obvious all unlike it lives — certainly no need explain each on its banner:`,
  '2#_': `(There Shach 5) And requires study not found, etc. — and I wrote z"l proved like Mechaber also esophagus-crop neveilah; forced Tosafot say not like Rambam; since difficult for Tosafot if neveilah while alive — what challenge and compare, etc.; perhaps "these treifos" means above slaughter place — since not slaughter place not neveilah while alive; must say even punctures at slaughter place not neveilah while alive; since punctured until treifah while alive — slaughter no longer purifies from neveilah; what difference crop area or esophagus — since punctured crop area treifah also neveilah per force; challenge well; compare — proves also esophagus-crop becomes neveilah per force; examine:`,
  '3#_': `(There hagahah seif 4) And all this not, etc. Shach s.k. 7 — do not challenge — say specifically when esophagus punctured thorn needle unknown place; per Rama end seif 23 hagahah even did not wait — not expert esophagus treifah any case; if only windpipe punctured thorn needle — concern esophagus treifah unknown place; same esophagus itself punctured thorn this place — concern perhaps also elsewhere unknown; per Shach deals saw entered among thorns only once not more — great forced; therefore I say Rama did not intend rule here only resolve Tosafot Rosh difficulty Rava esophagus no examination outside punctured one without other kosher how find — answer disease puncture; law if doubt thorn needle or disease — rely disease puncture; otherwise still difficult punctured one without other kosher even if disease in esophagus — say perhaps also thorn needle; but certainly stam not concern thorn when not seen done by thorn needle:`,
  '4#_': `(There seif 5) And if reversed. See Taz s.k. 8 — siman 57 flesh reddened opposite intestines — where saw lion entered; otherwise not; can explain Rashi words as Bach certainly reddened flesh — since common reddens from other cause — if no lion rely other; esophagus not common redden other cause — if inner reddened certainly derusah reddened only; can also explain Bach words explaining Ran — truth halachah not so since majority poskim do not hold so:`,
  '5#_': `(Shulchan Aruch seif 9) No drop outside. See Taz s.k. 16 — gemara does not imply forbid, etc. from Rav Kahana sat stated, etc.; in haste can compare his words since we rule drop alone not raise lower — prohibition only thorn found lying in esophagus says no need inform since all animals baraita eat thorns; but Rama Rashba need inform in such permitted; if no drop inside — what say all animals baraita have so; if drop inside — Rama permits; Taz challenged well; resolve Rashba Ran challenge Tosafot view puncture sat thorn with inside drop; found also deals sat with inside drop; but Rashi Ula not inside drop — Ula should explain found with inside drop says fine gemara found not needed; if with drop — Ula should explain with inside drop such; Rashba Ran prove even drop alone kosher — from divide without drop; proves Rama view; Taz added forbid inside drop; Kenesset HaGedolah attacked; attack not valid; can reject Taz proof; nevertheless stringent; proves Shach s.k. 17 found lying thorn if not stuck even drop outside kosher since drop not raise; found also both together nothing; per my view both together forbid — only inner permit; not outer:`,
  '6#_': `(There) But if stuck, etc. Shach s.k. 22 — difficult why Mechaber needed healed reason; nevertheless needed per his words above seif 7 puncture has examination from inside; seif 8 concern puncture examine dirty place — implies examination inside not concerned healed; must deal saw punctured before us slaughtered — short time certainly not healed:`,
  '7#_': `(There hagahah) And some permit, etc. Shach s.k. 21 — difficult; I say distinguish: thorn stuck before us — concern healed; for puncture not concerned — certainly if no puncture before us stuck — unknown place — esophagus eats drinks breathes — say perhaps outer also punctured; no examination — perhaps opposite inner puncture when punctured rose or fell — unknown place; if thorn stuck — known place — thorn blocks cannot fall; if not stuck not concerned healed — if healed healed entirely including inner skin; or not healed at all; unlike thorn stuck inner — say perhaps healed; see Taz s.k. 18 wants permission fattened geese majority flaw esophagus not from heat only disease — many acharonim only if saw disease did not rule at all; if ruled outer too treifah; seem explain Tosafot chapter HaShochet 28b s.v. came dripping blood, etc.; forced what wrote — say like disease puncture outer no disease discernible — Tosafot hold even disease puncture no examination outside unless disease did not rule outer at all — then outer not in doubt; truth esophagus no examination outside except thorn since common puncture — certainly punctured; outer certainly red not seen; disease say not punctured at all; if skin under disease ruled healthy — say not punctured; not like derusah ruling since outer red not seen; disease entire outer not seen; if partially seen also as Shach wrote:`,
});

// --- kol-yaakov (11) — Hebrew source is misplaced tefillin material; translated as written ---
patchFile('siman_033/kol-yaakov/part-001.txt', 'kol-yaakov', {
  '1#_': `A) Seif 1 if house-skins deteriorated, etc. If tefillin old — invalid since deteriorated from age; and some say Rama holds opposite — in new ones matter revealed that skin deteriorated since in short time torn — Taz s.k. 1:`,
  '2#_': `B) There one opposite one — even tear of one house down toward titura and other up — nevertheless invalid; Orach Tzedek ot 1 Avnei Nezer ot 1 Maleh HaOmer kelal 19 ot 9:`,
  '3#_': `C) There and if new kosher all while house-seat skin intact — meaning titura; Beit Yosef Bach Levush:`,
  '4#_': `D) There hagahah. Houses too must exist though slightly torn — torn between house and house but sides intact; Magen Avraham s.k. 2; likewise above must be intact; Machatzit HaShekel; and Beit Yosef houses must be intact all sides only torn between houses; Bach ruled so Kenesset HaGedolah Hagahot Beit Yosef ot 2 Orach Tzedek ot 1 and ot 3 Avnei Nezer ot 2 Raz Siman ot 1 Maleh HaOmer kelal 19 ot 9 Kaf HaChayim siman 24 ot 2 Emek She'elah kelal 17 ot 3 (see Levush Magen Avraham s.k. 1 and Peri Megadim Orach Chaim ot 1b); house ShY slightly torn invalid responsum Panim Yafot chelek 2 siman 10 brought Sha'arei Tora ot 1 Kaf HaChayim there; implies if puncture even slightly in house invalid; so Avnei Nezer siman 34 s.k. 6 see Kaf HaChayim there in Leshon Hakodesh ot 1; see responsum end Zivchei Ledek chelek 2 siman 10:`,
  '5#_': `E) There hagahah. And some say opposite, etc. — it appears to stringent invalidate both; and so Raz Siman ot 1 Maleh HaOmer there:`,
  '6#_': `F) There all while if they pull, etc. — this for those making ma'avarta from skin of houses; but for us ma'avarta separate skin — not applicable; Bach Taz s.k. 2 Bayit HaTov ot 2 Maleh HaOmer there; Peri Megadim Mishnat Zekeinim see our words above siman 32 ot 200 and practical difference:`,
  '7#_': `G) There and if two deteriorated, etc. first and third, etc. — implies two adjacent even tears not adjacent but side by side called opposite — invalid; Taz s.k. 3; so Levush explaining Magen Avraham s.k. 3; Avnei Nezer ot 3 Raz Siman ot 1 Kaf HaChayim siman 24 ot 2 Emek She'elah kelal 17 ot 3:`,
  '8#_': `H) Seif 2 if they separated, etc. all while house-seat skin, etc. — that Rama did not emend here too like previous seif houses must exist; see Levush who questioned and perhaps relied on above:`,
  '9#_': `I) There hagahah. And some say, etc. — good to concern for both explanations as above; and so Raz Siman ot 2 Maleh HaOmer kelal 19 ot 8 Kaf HaChayim siman 24 ot 4 Emek She'elah kelal 18 ot 4; all while cannot repair and no others — leave without blessing Kaf HaChayim there:`,
  '10#_': `J) Seif 3 strap-skins, etc. must be processed for its sake; if not invalid per Rashi; even for lenient on houses Raz Siman ot 3 — no remedy even if blackened for its sake; Darkei Shmuel siman 19 Sha'arei Tora ot 5 Maleh HaOmer kelal 20 ot 1 Kaf HaChayim siman 23 ot 1 Emek She'elah kelal 19 ot 1; not like responsum Be'er Eshek siman 10 who permitted blackened for its sake; see Sha'arei Tora there and Maleh HaOmer there in Binah ot 1 what wondered on Bayit HaTov:`,
  '11#_': `K) Wrote in Sefer HaKavanot on tefillin drush 4: good to process two skins — one head straps one hand straps; when placing skin in lime and water if for head straps intend for God's name and spell Y-H-V-H; if for hand straps intend for Sh-D-Y and spell Adonai — end. Though I did not see practiced so — wrote for precise workers Avnei Nezer siman 32 ot 17:`,
});

// --- yad-avraham (8) ---
patchFile('siman_033/yad-avraham/part-001.txt', 'yad-avraham', {
  '1#_': `(Siman 33 seif 3) Esophagus punctured into cavity any amount neveilah. See Tevu'ot Shor Shach Kenesset HaGedolah on Rambam; Tosafot Bekhorot 3a implies Rava esophagus punctured only treifah while alive; so Rosh chapter 2 Chullin 30 in name Rabbenu Tam; so Kenesset HaGedolah per Rambam; not Tevu'ot Shor Shach; see my composition on Rambam Laws Shechitah chapter 3 halachah 19 where I elaborated:`,
  '2#_': `(Seif 4) Two membranes esophagus one punctured kosher even not opposite forbidden. Pri Megadim wrote both not opposite only safek treifah even not far — practical difference safek safeka; precise from Mechaber "possible align" — only safek treifah; hidden from him Rambam Laws Shechitah chapter 3 halachah 20 wrote both not opposite neveilah; Shulchan Aruch also not decisive — intent only one wind possibly align treifah — exclude two winds kosher when impossible align; unlike one wind since possible align surely consider;`,
  '3#_': `(Hagahah) All this only clear disease puncture; if concern thorn treifah even only inner. Shach means not only known thorn treifah but mere concern treifah until known disease; difficult hagahah siman 49 seif 2 and 51 if doubt thorn or disease permitted double doubt; Kenesset HaGedolah wrote here common puncture; found Taz siman 49 disputes leniency; appears explain Rama hagahah concern thorn even only inner treifah; wrote "all the more if only outer alone"; Bayit HaTov many wondered; my explanation: all the more concern outer thorn treifah — no double doubt disease; if thorn perhaps only inner — such double doubt not double doubt — doubt from lack knowledge not expert examination even inside; not help without great loss; law gemara examination esophagus inside chapter HaShochet 28; unlike concern inner thorn complete double doubt disease thorn perhaps only inner; outer examination known place kosher Shach; not Shach outer thorn not rely all more stringent; law outer unknown puncture rely disease siman 51 double safek; presumption permit after slaughter; inner organs thorn uncommon; even doubt since slaughtered permitted; difficult Taz siman 49 esophagus doubt thorn — no Kenesset HaGedolah common; Tosafot siman 51 only derusah; esophagus doubt slaughter safek issur stringent; no other acharonim views; outer thorn rely thorn; examine;`,
  '4#_': `(Seif 5) Outer red inner white reversed both red or white treifah. Maharshal permits both white — white not flaw; unclear — proven Rashi Rosh Rashba Shulchan Aruch white is flaw; as lung siman 38 seif 44 s.k. 8 regarding kidney white is flaw; gemara Nazir 38 and Gittin 68 white in black is flaw; Rashi Tosafot white patch on black skin certainly from blisters lesion was there; if so here say white in red skin is flaw — black red only because flawed then black then white — examine well:`,
  '5#_': `(Seif 9) Thorn found lying in esophagus along length kosher. Hagahot Maimoniyot Tur if no drop outside; Shach disputes Tur does not imply; Hagahot Maimoniyot does not decide; hidden from him Ran beginning siman 51 Rashba Teshuvot HaRishonim 30 explicitly even found lying without piece with drop outside treifah; bring proof gemara; Taz omitted — all his proof explicitly Rashba Ran — therefore do not lenient; long after writing found Sefer Torat Yekutiel attacked Shach hidden Rashba Ran — pleased study:`,
  '6#_': `(There) But if stuck forbidden, etc. Hagahah some permit no drop outside — not concerned healed — Rosh; above seif 4 hagahah forbid concern only inner thorn concern perhaps outer; when not stuck not concern outer; when found stuck inner skin alone not concern outer — clear Rosh siman 51 source hagahah here seif 4; Shach lengthened unnecessarily arrived this view himself hidden Rosh words — Kenesset HaGedolah Tevu'ot Shor; know from Rosh siman 51 clearly since not concerned healed even examination turning see if through-and-through — ruled like Ula not concerned; Ula even examination not required; compares esophagus needle thickness beit ha-kosot one side we rule kosher even examination unnecessary Beit Yosef hagahah siman 48 seif 8 some permit; ruled so Kitzur Piskei HaRav permit b'dieved if cannot check e.g. washed; appears hagahah here ruled permit not concerned healed no drop outside; though perhaps drop outside not seen red; or food drink washed — washed; if one side kosher examination passed; wonder Taz forbade beit ha-kosot b'dieved cannot check — here permits stuck inside alone; rather stringent esophagus more Rif and supporters as Rosh see; do not challenge there Kitzur Piskei HaRav lenient only say there perhaps if came before us would puncture as gemara needle piece lung 48 — unlike here no flaw before us examine all possible; Rosh siman 51 regarding esophagus examination derusah; Shach siman 48 s.k. 32; conclusion: summer thorn stuck inner skin must turn examine outside if not examined kosher; seems simple opposite place thorn stuck inner outer white — though all rule examination helps known place Shach s.k. 7 — nevertheless treifah this outer white turned red like puncture poskim (see Bayit HaTov s.k. 12) — punctured through-and-through; clear:`,
  '7#_': `(Hagahah) Geese fattened, etc. See Bayit HaTov responsum Emunat Shmuel fattened geese cover blood before esophagus examination rely majority; see responsum Tzitz Eliezer distinguish this from siman 28 animal examines lung first — there slaughterer examines unlike geese slaughterer does not examine esophagus; Hagahot Sefer Beit Yosef wrote another reason geese fattened if examine before lacking examination — question nothing lacking between slaughter and covering as written gemara pour and cover; however specifically bird attached; animal verse not particular nothing lacking — otherwise all animals need no covering all need lung examination; rather verse pour and cover — whoever lacks only pouring and covering excluded pediyah gerirah etc. — only bird; his words unclear — is lung or esophagus examination Torah reduced verse pour cover — rabbinic and from Torah not lacking; why reduce covering; further only when lacking pediyah gerirah verse particular action lack — examination mere seeing; so Sanhedrin 40 and Ran chapter 2 Gittin; Rama 28b pour blood refers animal only bird father not proof — not rule bird from Torah no shechitah and we do not hold so:`,
  '8#_': `(Seif 11 hagahah) Intestine punctured between crop. Doubt perhaps gizzard puncture any amount (Taz); Mordechai siman 51 Rivba explains what stretches with it gemara roof crop 56 — clearly that intestine belongs gizzard and intestines puncture any amount; Beit Yosef brought though Beit Yosef wrote his words individual only roof crop not intestine; seems from Rashi siman 51 58 regarding two children intestines opposite bird kosher — some say every bird from crop to gizzard one intestine tract called children intestines; complete intestines exit gizzard head — end; so Rambam; Shulchan Aruch siman 47; therefore seems not lenient make doubt as some acharonim; against Rashi Rambam Mordechai Rivba:`,
});

// --- yad-ephraim (6) ---
patchFile('siman_033/yad-ephraim/part-001.txt', 'yad-ephraim', {
  '1#_': `In any amount neveilah. See Bayit HaTov wrote Shvut Yaakov chelek 3 matter 59 esophagus attached to cheeks wounds even if in esophagus-crop area — since lower cheek flesh whole healthy — like initial sealing kosher; Noda Biyehudah siman 9 wrote if esophagus punctured near head attached flesh — treifah; do not say flesh seals — two membranes much attached nevertheless say not opposite treifah because compressed; same sometimes compressed not remaining attached; perhaps crop area Noda Biyehudah agrees sealing helps; Noda Biyehudah Mahari"t middle siman 23 birds head skin pierced opposite nape — watch perhaps deep from sides; if no flaw in side fat deep — no concern esophagus puncture:`,
  '2#_': `Inner red treifah. Bayit HaTov Noda Biyehudah siman 15 fattened goose inner skin drop opposite outer no change elsewhere outer turned white — flaw partially as Tevu'ot Shor — like punctured not opposite treifah; l'chatchila need not search outer for white — stringent if sees white; see there if shows inner passed through impeachment narrowing saliva — redness not flaw will not spoil puncture — permit see there:`,
  '3#_': `No examination from outside. Bayit HaTov see Noda Biyehudah siman 8 weighed Rashi explained drop not inside; Shach s.k. 21 why reason perhaps healed; see there wrote distinguish short time swallow thorn not concerned healed — see there:`,
  '4#_': `Examine trachea from outside. Bayit HaTov see responsum Panim Me'rot siman 1: First I explain law esophagus-crop; saw many puzzled in this country fattened geese examining esophagus piece toward head blisters near swallowing place — many say above crop area cheeks seal puncture there initial sealing; each gives own measure many stumble; I wrote inside its law — all below jaw in esophagus-crop area; jaw place known only one skin bright slightly low see inside: b) sometimes removing esophagus force peels outer skin by hands — inner punctured there — doubt need examination through-and-through; wherever cannot examine treifah very common many permit none speak out; I strongly urge stringent majority geonim found no warriors for this; lone lenient view: c) sometimes blisters at shechitah place appears slaughtered in blister inner cut in two blister part toward head part body — concern slaughtered at puncture; gemara concern all slaughtered at puncture place bar goose dripping blood: d) separating membranes find between small bubbles fine like mustard seeds white no fluid — if after scraping no flaw underneath permit: e) sometimes both membranes extremely white not reddish — doubt Shulchan Aruch treifah both white; some say from fat turned white; I say who decided — perhaps fattening disease; wrote inside can side lenient: f) fattened geese common ruling liver melted blood Rama Bach treifah — fit heed their mouths; though Taz attacked — wrote inside Taz words unclear — fit stringent at least for himself: g) peeling membranes blood clotted between — scraping blood missing bit skin — outer both intact no flaw world law this esophagus (see responsum body permits if no mark like white dot as below seif 14): h) women practice rinse esophagus water day night before teacher — seems improper — need check after drop; acharonim forbid if salted washed without presumption like needle beit ha-kosot: i) sometimes outer skin blood clotted from constantly rubbing to wash dry balls in esophagus — inner flawless world law if forbid like bar goose dripping blood practiced forbid here: j) sometimes inner mostly all blisters sometimes like punctured though outer flawless — Rosh forbids both red or white since one flawed cannot stand on second; Bach majority as all Torah; kal v'chomer here greatest flaw entire skin like punctured though outer flawless: k) if punctured not opposite one wind even far poskim forbid; when inner flawed outer drop — side forbid: l) peeling see outer scar sometimes white hard strands more than flesh — as if tore healed like membrane from blow esophagus not significant membrane: m) side permit where one skin punctured healed healed opposite no flaw outer outer puncture not opposite this place — say significant membrane though from blow since outer protects intact comfortable per majority; inside elaborated: n) after scraping blister if dot remains as complete opening all discernible marks dot whiter healed many ignore think dot no flaw — error — clear from blow healed; practical difference if outer dot — punctured through-and-through: o) sometimes both punctured healed membrane rose outer fat stuck not sealing unlike gizzard fat sealing strongly stuck — this fat like scab; perhaps fat peeled from joint stuck esophagus — joint flesh does not save esophagus puncture sealing — same this fat simple clear stam: see Panim Me'rot chelek 2 siman 13 fattened geese drop between membranes elaborated chelek 1 no house concern Taz lenient even blow ruled outer; greater since practice Taz no need peel; practice peel elders compromise not lenient only inner not ruled outer — if ruled outer treifah therefore peeled know if blow ruled outer; now lenient per Taz — peeling unnecessary labor; main if no drop outside permit see there; also siman 103 per geonim second thread stringent agreed permit one skin punctured disease did not rule second — if ruled outer treifah peeled; practice all lands per Taz — why peel — outer intact no drop outside enough; said end siman 103; heard Presburg practiced; Prostitz surroundings lenient per Taz — why peel; wrote many stumbling blocks from fattening; Bach cried abolish from Israel; all decisors cannot emerge clean ruling; Peri Megadim chelek 1 siman 1 see there; siman 103 esophagus had flaw brought teacher not home — daughters cat ate esophagus household said flaw only bit inner skin — permit pillars we rely even without presumption not punctured both sides though not checked drop lost; see Be'er HaGolah siman 48 name Gaon Mahari Mendel see there:`,
  '5#_': `At end where there is flaw. See Bayit HaTov wrote Shvut Yaakov chelek 3 siman 60 button found near spine food barley spike — forbid concern esophagus puncture not expert; simple even non-fattened goose same law:`,
  '6#_': `Punctured. Perhaps gizzard; Beit Yehudah; Pri Chadash; Panim Me'rot siman 12 bird without crop goose bar goose needle stuck flesh near gizzard toward esophagus not outside kosher — all the more permit several times bar geese flesh blisters worms inside not outside — further leniency disease rot; can lenient bird with crop; Peri Megadim Mishbetzot s.k. 21; Chavot Yair siman 28 asked blisters bar geese end esophagus near gizzard buttons bubbles worms inside punctures inside — answered from bar geese sense worms their species not outside; opening buttons hairs wound circle; many buttons; mostly upper bubble flesh doctor scraped — turn bubble examine outer bubble flesh scraped — like both sides treifah; if beyond second intact — only worms — if worms not both sides by worms forbid per Derishah Shach siman 31 s.k. 7 only gizzard lenient; other organ no outer flaw; esophagus doubt live separated after death; most buttons gizzard not esophagus; not concerned healed worm does not allow heal — better than stuck thorn; worms born birds; if from outside as asker — dispute Shach siman 36 s.k. 15 — end see there:`,
});

